5,0,1,talk,Sakura,,"Yay! I'm so excited to play this game with everyone! Hehe, I wonder who the big, scary werewolf is? Maybe we can all be friends while we solve the mystery! Does anyone have a fun plan?","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Minako,,"It is a pleasure to meet you all. Since we have no information yet, I suggest we use today to observe each other's behavior and communication styles. Let us maintain a calm and open dialogue for now.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Victoria,,I agree with Minako. Observation is our most reliable tool at this stage. I will be paying close attention to how everyone reacts to the uncertainty of the first day. Let us see what patterns emerge.,"{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Takumi,,"I'm ready! I don't need a ""fun plan,"" I just want to find the wolf and protect everyone. I'll be watching closely to see who's lying. Let's just be honest and get this over with!","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Misaki,,"I agree with the general consensus. Since we have no clues yet, it is best to remain observant and composed. I will be listening carefully to everyone's contributions to see if any inconsistencies arise.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Takumi, you're so serious! Hehe, but that's okay! I'll be watching too, but I'll do it with a smile! I wonder if the werewolf is trying to act all calm and quiet right now? Ooh, so mysterious!","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Minako,,"@Sakura, while a cheerful demeanor is pleasant, we must remember that both the werewolf and the possessed may use any personality—whether quiet or energetic—as a mask. Let us not let our first impressions cloud our judgment.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Victoria,,"Minako is correct. A persona is merely a surface. I am interested in the gaps between what people say and how they say it. @Sakura, your energy is noted, but I wonder if it serves as a distraction.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Minako"",""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Victoria, don't just pick on Sakura! She's just being herself. I'm more worried about people who are too focused on ""patterns"" and ""masks."" That sounds like something a wolf would say to confuse us!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Victoria"",""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Takumi, it is natural to be wary, but analyzing patterns is a logical approach to a game of deception. We should avoid jumping to conclusions based on how someone speaks. Let us stay focused on the facts.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Sakura,,"@Victoria, a distraction? Me? Hehe, you're so funny! I'm just happy to be here! @Takumi, thank you for defending me! You're like a big brother! I'll be the best little detective ever!","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Victoria"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Minako,,"It is heartening to see such camaraderie, but we must remain vigilant. @Takumi, your protectiveness is kind, but let us ensure it does not create a blind spot. We should all be equally scrutinized to ensure the village's safety.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Victoria,,"I appreciate Minako's caution. Blind spots are where the werewolf thrives. @Takumi, your instinct to protect is admirable, but in this game, trust must be earned through consistency, not just through a feeling of kinship.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Minako"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Takumi,,"@Victoria, I don't need a ""feeling"" to know when someone's being too cold! You're just trying to make us doubt each other. I'll trust my gut and my eyes, and I won't let the wolf trick me!","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Misaki,,"@Takumi, relying solely on your gut can be dangerous in a game designed to deceive. While emotions are natural, we should prioritize objective evidence. Let us continue to observe without letting personal friction distract us from the goal.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Sakura,,"@Misaki, you're so smart! I'll try my best to be objective, but I'll still keep my detective heart open! Hehe, I hope everyone has sweet dreams tonight! Good luck to the Seer! Bye-bye!","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
21,0,4,pass,Sakura,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
22,0,4,talk,Minako,,I agree with Misaki. Let us conclude today's discussion with a clear mind. I wish you all a peaceful night. I look forward to seeing how our observations evolve tomorrow.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
23,0,4,pass,Minako,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
24,0,4,talk,Victoria,,I shall also retire for the evening. I will be reflecting on today's interactions and the dynamics that have already begun to form. I hope the Seer's vision provides us with a clear path forward. Good night.,"{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
25,0,4,pass,Victoria,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
26,0,4,talk,Takumi,,"I'm not letting my guard down! I'll be thinking about everything everyone said tonight. Good luck, Seer—find the wolf so we can kick them out! Goodnight, everyone!","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
27,0,4,pass,Takumi,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
28,0,4,talk,Misaki,,"I agree. Let us all rest and prepare for tomorrow. I hope the Seer finds a helpful clue to guide us. Good night, everyone.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
