69,2,1,talk,Sakura,,"Oh no! Victoria is gone! That's so scary! Hehe, I can't believe it! @everyone, does this mean the wolf is still hiding among us? I'm getting goosebumps! Who do you think is the real bad guy now?","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,2,1,talk,Minako,,It is a tragedy that we lost Victoria. The fact that she was attacked immediately after Takumi's execution suggests the werewolf viewed her as a significant threat or a logical obstacle. We must now analyze the remaining players with even greater scrutiny.,"{""words"":42,""mentions"":[""Victoria"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,2,1,talk,Misaki,,"@Minako, I agree. Victoria's attack confirms that the werewolf is likely someone who felt threatened by her logical approach. With only three of us left, the margin for error is gone. We must be extremely careful.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Minako"",""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,2,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Minako, @Misaki, you're both so serious! It's just us three now! Hehe, it's like the final round of a mystery book! If the Seer is still here, they must know something super important! Please tell us! I'm too scared to guess again!","{""words"":42,""mentions"":[""Minako"",""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,2,2,talk,Minako,,"I am the Seer. I have divined both Takumi and Victoria, and both were human. This means the werewolf is either Sakura or Misaki. Since the werewolf is still among us, we must decide who is lying.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Victoria"",""Sakura"",""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,2,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Minako, thank you for revealing your role and the results. Since you have confirmed that Takumi and Victoria were human, the circle has narrowed significantly. @Sakura, what do you have to say for yourself?","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Minako"",""Takumi"",""Victoria"",""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,2,3,talk,Sakura,,"What?! @Minako, you're the Seer? That's so cool! But wait... that means it's me or @Misaki? No way! I'm just a little girl! I'm a regular human, I promise! Hehe, this is like a scary movie! @Misaki, you're the wolf, aren't you?","{""words"":42,""mentions"":[""Minako"",""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,2,3,talk,Minako,,"@Sakura, emotional appeals do not provide evidence. @Misaki, you have remained composed and logical throughout, but as I noted before, that can also be a mask. Between the two of you, who is truly the wolf?","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Sakura"",""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,2,3,talk,Misaki,,"@Minako, my composure is not a mask, but a way to ensure we don't make another mistake. @Sakura, your sudden accusation is a classic deflection. If you are the wolf, you are simply trying to panic us.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Minako"",""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,2,4,talk,Sakura,,"@Misaki, that's not a deflection! I'm just really scared! Hehe, you're always so calm and perfect, it's actually a bit spooky now! @Minako, please believe me! I'm just a little detective, not a big scary wolf! I vote for Misaki!","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Misaki"",""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,2,4,talk,Minako,,"@Sakura, your fear is noted, but it is not proof of innocence. @Misaki, your logic is consistent, yet the Possessed would also mimic such behavior to blend in. However, the werewolf must be one of you. I vote for Misaki.","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Sakura"",""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
80,2,4,talk,Misaki,,"@Minako, I am disappointed that you would vote for me based on a suspicion of my demeanor. @Sakura, your panic is a poor substitute for evidence. If you execute me, the wolf wins. I am human; Sakura is the wolf.","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Minako"",""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
